#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Archived multistage recipes for the two final ConvPrefill weight sets.

Starts trainable convolution weights at identity; never trains LLM parameters.
Prints the plan by default; --execute starts training on a Linux CUDA host.
The launcher snapshots are embedded, so later launcher edits cannot change
this archive. Training/building Python implementations remain dependencies.

Qwen's first-stage trainer arguments were recovered from its saved log, but
the original dataset generation command is absent. Supply that original
16000-example training JSONL; this script deliberately does not invent it.
Later stage settings follow the saved launchers, not verified full run logs.
Retraining does not promise identical weights or exact historical scores.
"""
